              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether, in a typical case requiring an Environmental Impact Statement (EIS), it would be normal to enjoin the government action until the EIS is filed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
