            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether there is any record evidence that beaked whales would be killed by the sonar exercises."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "145d597c9b41db5665873a4d692dfb6025df65d0225d5fd65c136d5961222b42",
