        "text": "According to Petitioners, the case concerns the Navy\u2019s use of mid\u2011frequency active (MFA) sonar in training exercises and a Ninth Circuit injunction that places serious restrictions on that use."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
